Description: Functional data handling for functional geostatistics. Observed
    curves are smoothed and represented through their empirical functional
    principal components, so that spatial prediction of curves reduces to
    the spatial modelling of the score components. The geostatistical
    modelling of the scores is decoupled from the package: scores can be
    exported to 'gstat', and fitted variogram models can be translated back
    into a common representation. References: Bohorquez, M., Giraldo, R.,
    and Mateu, J. (2016) <doi:10.1007/s10260-015-0340-9>, Bohorquez, M.,
    Giraldo, R., and Mateu, J. (2016) <doi:10.1007/s00477-016-1266-y>,
    Bohorquez M., Giraldo R. and Mateu J. (2021) <doi:10.1002/9781119387916>.
